# Mathematics in Litex
# Selected mathematics adapted from Mathematics in Lean. See NOTICE.md.
# This distribution contains the preface and Chapters 1–8 in dependency order.
# It translates mathematical definitions and proof ideas, not Lean tactic syntax.
# Repeated Lean demonstrations of the same result may share one Litex proof.
# Chapter presence does not mean every upstream item has been translated.
# All exported source is checked with strict mode; builtin/inference rules and
# named foundation releases remain part of the Litex verification boundary.
# No Lean kernel certification is claimed. Later chapters are not exported.
